Vendors are classified using **six mandatory dimensions**:

| Dimension                | Description                      |Weight|
|--------------------------|----------------------------------|-----|
| Data Sensitivity         | Classification of data processed | 30% |
| Operational Dependency   | Impact on business continuity    | 20% |
| Integration Depth        | API, network, system integration | 15% |
| AI Exposure              | AI training, inference, logging  | 15% |
| Jurisdictional Risk      | Country laws, geopolitical risk  | 10% |
| Sub‑processor Complexity | Number & transparency            | 10% |

### Final Tiering Levels
- **Tier 1 — Critical**  
- **Tier 2 — High**  
- **Tier 3 — Moderate**  
- **Tier 4 — Low**  

